-## Tables
-
-Use HTML tables to present tabular data.
-
-<table>
-  <tr>
-    <th>Header Type</th>
-    <th>Markdown</th>
-    <th>Use</th>
-  </tr>
-  <tr>
-    <td><code>&lt;h1&gt;</code></td>
-    <td>#</td>
-    <td>Title of page</td>
-  </tr>
-  <tr>
-    <td><code>&lt;h2&gt;</code></td>
-    <td>##</td>
-    <!-- can use Markdown too; remember blank lines -->
-    <td>
-
-      **Second level headers**
-
-    </td>
-  </tr>
-  <tr>
-    <td><code>&lt;h3&gt;</code></td>
-    <td>###</td>
-    <td>
-
-      **Third level headers**
-
-    </td>
-  </tr>
-</table>
